# The Ultimate Doom E3M6 (M9): started beside line 662 (special 51, tag 0), on its
# front, the player uses it, then waits for the movers it set going
# (at most 450 tics). Written by tools/RouteGen (doom-e3m6-line662).
iwad doom
map E3M6
exit secret
start 896 3088 90

# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
0 0 0 0 x2
0 0 0 2
